## Import

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/resources/sapintegrationsuite_api_provider/import.sh" }}

The ID is the provider's name. Everything except the password is recovered; the imported
provider keeps the password SAP holds.

## Limitations

- **SAP:** no update through the API. Reserved names (for example `DEST_CI`, `APIMGMT_PORTAL`,
  `TC_*`) are rejected by SAP at apply time.
- **Provider:** only the Internet connection type. On-premise (Cloud Connector), Open
  Connectors and Cloud Integration connections have field sets that could not be confirmed and
  are configured in the UI. `auth_type` is only confirmed for `BASIC`.

